="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君を離さずに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여전히 너를 붙잡은 채</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je m’accroche encore à toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aferrándome a ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Halte ich an dir fest</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ainda me apegando a você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я всё ещё держусь за тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Restando aggrappato a te</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:55.090" end="1:57.390"><span begin="1:55.090" end="1:55.270">(No</span> <span begin="1:55.270" end="1:55.500">mat</span><span begin="1:55.500" end="1:55.730">ter</span> <span begin="1:55.940" end="1:56.220">where</span> <span begin="1:56.320" end="1:56.540">you</span> <span begin="1:56.540" end="1:57.390">are)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你身在何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">無論你身在何方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">君がどこにいても</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 어디에 있든</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Peu importe où tu es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No importa dónde estés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ganz gleich wo du bist</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não importa onde você esteja</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Где бы ты ни был</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non importa dove tu sia</span></span></p><p begin="1:58.510" end="2:00.020" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.510" end="1:58.580">A</span><span begin="1:58.720" end="1:58.910">mid</span> <span begin="1:59.000" end="1:59.200">shi</span><span begin="1:59.200" end="1:59.250">f</span><span begin="1:59.330" end="1:59.430">ting</span> <span begin="1:59.580" end="1:59.850">tide</span><span begin="1:59.850" end="2:00.020">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">置身不断变幻的潮汐之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">置身不斷變幻的潮汐之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">移ろう潮の中で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">변해 가는 물결 속에서도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au milieu des marées changeantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entre mareas cambiantes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Inmitten wechselnder Gezeiten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Em meio às marés que mudam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Среди меняющихся течений</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tra maree mutevoli</span></p><p begin="2:00.220" end="2:04.590" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.220" end="2:00.340">Kee</span><span begin="2:00.440" end="2:00.610">ping</span> <span begin="2:00.710" end="2:00.900">some</span><span begin="2:01.060" end="2:01.160">thing</span> <span begin="2:01.290" end="2:02.140">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍守着那份真实</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">仍守著那份真實</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">変わらない想いを抱いて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">변치 않는 무언가를 간직하며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Gardant quelque chose de vrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Conservando algo verdadero</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Bewahre ich etwas Wahres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Guardando algo verdadeiro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Храня нечто истинное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Custodendo qualcosa di vero</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:01.960" end="2:04.590"><span begin="2:01.960" end="2:02.050">(The</span> <span begin="2:02.180" end="2:02.420">wor</span><span begin="2:02.420" end="2:02.470">ds</span> <span begin="2:02.570" end="