" xml:lang="de">Ich trug jedes Wort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levei comigo cada palavra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неся с собой каждое слово</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho portato con me ogni parola</span></p><p begin="2:15.790" end="2:21.960" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.790" end="2:16.550">Right</span> <span begin="2:16.670" end="2:17.250">where</span> <span begin="2:17.340" end="2:17.640">it</span> <span begin="2:17.760" end="2:18.190">be</span><span begin="2:18.420" end="2:21.870">long</span><span begin="2:21.870" end="2:21.960">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去往它们应归之处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">去往它們應歸之處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">あるべき場所へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 말들이 있어야 할 바로 그곳으로</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Jusqu’à l’endroit où il devait être</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Justo adonde pertenece</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Genau dorthin wo es hingehört</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Exatamente para onde ela pertence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Туда где ему и место</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Proprio dove deve stare</span></p><p begin="2:32.370" end="2:35.350" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.370" end="2:32.540">S</span><span begin="2:32.540" end="2:32.990">till</span> <span begin="2:32.990" end="2:33.420">I</span> <span begin="2:33.610" end="2:34.030">can</span> <span begin="2:34.030" end="2:34.400">hear</span> <span begin="2:34.500" end="2:35.350">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依然能够听见你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我依然能夠聽見你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今も君の声が聞こえる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">지금도 네 목소리가 들려</span><span tt