treiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare</span></p><p begin="3:07.250" end="3:13.210" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.250" end="3:08.930">空</span><span begin="3:08.930" end="3:09.710">へ</span><span begin="3:09.830" end="3:10.630">と</span><span begin="3:11.310" end="3:11.610">溶</span><span begin="3:11.760" end="3:12.030">け</span><span begin="3:12.180" end="3:12.460">て</span><span begin="3:12.460" end="3:12.520">い</span><span begin="3:12.610" end="3:13.210">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐融入天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸融入天空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Melting into the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘로 녹아들어 가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous fondrons dans le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos fundiremos con el cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und uns im Himmel auflösen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dissolvendo-nos no céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Растворяясь в небе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sciogliendoci nel cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora e to tokete iku</span></p><p begin="3:13.660" end="3:16.580" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:13.660" end="3:14.120">We</span> <span begin="3:14.120" end="3:14.780">will</span> <span begin="3:14.780" end="3:15.440">let</span> <span begin="3:15.440" end="3:15.550">it</span> <span begin="3:15.670" end="3:16.580">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让它离去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就讓它離去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは手放してゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 이제 놓아줄 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous laisserons tout partir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Lo dejaremos ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden es loslassen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos deixar tudo ir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы отпустим всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lasceremo andare tutto</span></p><p begin="3:17.090" end="3:20.440" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.090" end="3:17.550">We</span> <span begin="3:17.550" end="3:18.060">will</span> <span begin="3:18.150" end="3:18.500">dri</span><span begin="3:18.500" end="3:18.620">f</span><span begin="3:18.620" end="3:18.920">t a</span><span begin="3:19.040" end="3:19.390">way</span> <span begin="3:19.480" end="3:19.590">to</span><span begin="3:19.700" end="3:20.120">ge</span><span begin="3:20.120" end="3:20.440">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们会一同漂向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們會一同漂向遠方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らは共に漂ってゆく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 함께 흘러가겠지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous nous laisserons dériver ensemble</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nos dejaremos llevar juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir werden gemeinsam davontreiben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vamos nos deixar levar juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы уплывём вдаль вместе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci lasceremo trasportare insieme</span></p><p begin="3:20.780" end="3:30.230" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.780" end="3:21.840">旅</span><span begin="3:21.840" end="3:22.660">の</span><span begin="3:22.660" end="3:23.240">果</span><span begin="3:23.330" end="3:23.450">て</span><span begin="3:23.540" end="3:24.310">で</span> <span begin="3:24.810" end="3:25.470">君</span><span begin="3:25.470" end="3:25.590">に</span><span begin="3:25.680" end="3:26.220">届</span><span begin="3:26.330" end="3:26.840">け</span><span begin="3:26.960" end="3:30.230">よう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在旅途的尽头 将这一切传达给你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在旅途的盡頭 將這一切傳達給你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">At the journey&apos;s end I&apos;ll send it to you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">여행의 끝에서 너에게 전할게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Au bout du voyage je ferai en sorte que ces mots te parviennent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Al final del viaje haré que llegue hasta ti</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Am Ende der Reise werde ich es dir übermitteln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">No fim da jornada farei isso chegar até você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И в конце пути я донесу это до тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Alla fine del viaggio farò in modo che ti raggiunga</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tabi no hate de kimi ni todokeyou</span></p><p begin="3:31.910" end="3:37.040" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.910" end="3:32.280">Right</span> <span begin="3:32.360" end="3:32.800">where</span> <span begin="3:32.800" end="3:33.110">we</span> <span begin="3:33.220" end="3:33.770">be</span><span begin="3:33.850" end="3:37.040">long</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就在我们应归之处</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">就在我們應歸之處</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">僕らがいるべき場所へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 있어야 할 바로 그곳에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Là exactement où est notre place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Justo donde debemos estar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Genau dort wo wir hingehören</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Exatamente onde pertencemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Там где нам и место</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Proprio dove apparteniamo</span></p></div></body></tt>